SY_TALK("92xyoIXzACo",[[0,["Last time I talked to you about collectivity outside your own shell,"]],[11,["how, after your Realisation, after your second birth,"]],[20,["you become conscious that you are no more an egg but, now,"]],[28,["you have become part and parcel of the whole."]],[32,["You realise it gradually."]],[38,["In the beginning only what you feel is nothing but cool breeze"]],[46,["blowing into your hands or maybe little tingling sometimes"]],[51,["or maybe some heaviness, to begin with."]],[54,["But then, gradually you realise it."]],[58,["Some people do realise it in a very quick way."]],[64,["But as the infrastructure within is not properly fixed,"]],[76,["Realisation comes very, very slowly."]],[80,["I spoke to you about our infrastructure within."]],[86,["Now the faith in God or faith in anything that is Divine,"]],[97,["also in the Divine Power, is not easy to achieve logically."]],[106,["Some people have faith in God because they have been taught"]],[111,["from childhood that there is God."]],[113,["Maybe they think that by relying on something like God,"]],[116,["somewhere in the air, they are doing better in life."]],[120,["There could be many reasons why people have faith in God."]],[125,["But actually, when you feel the presence of Divine Power within you and outside,"]],[135,["it is hard to believe that it is the Divine Power."]],[140,["And even if you know all about it, it is difficult to assume it."]],[147,["It’s sometimes a surprise to many Sahaja Yogis,"]],[152,["when they see around people who have got Realisation,"]],[157,["who have got cool breeze flowing from their hand and they disappear."]],[161,["They just can’t understand such people that – how it has happened"]],[165,["that these people have come to a program, one day,"]],[168,["they have got Realisation, they have got cool breeze"]],[173,["and then they have disappeared?"]],[174,["Are they the people who are little-believers or half-baked"]],[180,["or mediocres?"]],[181,["Or what is it that they have no curiosity any further to go?"]],[187,["Or that they are not intelligent enough to understand that there’s something"]],[194,["very dynamic, something very new, very natural that has happened to them?"]],[201,["It is not a cult, they can see for themselves,"]],[205,["because as in a cult there’s a mass hysteria"]],[210,["or some abnormalities, there’s no abnormality with these people,"]],[215,["they are very normal."]],[216,["Despite all these things, all the proof to believe"]],[219,["that there is Divine Power around us and that now it is flowing through you,"]],[225,["it’s there."]],[227,["But still people don’t believe in it. Then why? What is the reason?"]],[231,["We have to see what is the reason why we are not able to still accept"]],[240,["that this is what it is."]],[247,["The time when great incarnations were on this Earth,"]],[252,["when people like Mohammed and people like Christ, Gautam Buddha,"]],[258,["all these people came on this Earth – very recently I should say –"]],[263,["nobody believed that they are incarnations or they are Son of God."]],[268,["I mean this is the only problem they had – to accept that He was Son of God."]],[272,["I mean this was the only problem they were struggling with, all of them,"]],[275,["whether they were Jews or Muslims and such communities,"]],[281,["they could not accept that He was the Son of God."]],[284,["I mean what is the harm in accepting the situation."]],[287,["Supposing He is the Son of God, after all there’s no property distribution"]],[291,["going on, there’s nothing like a will God has written that, “I’ll give it to my Son,”"]],[295,["that we should contest it."]],[296,["But people could not accept it."]],[299,["Now one may say that, at that time, that nobody felt the cool breeze,"]],[306,["nobody felt the connection with the whole."]],[311,["But today also, today also the situation is the same."]],[316,["Situation is the same because of a single simple reason that:"]],[325,["we ourselves are not integrated, we ourselves are not part of ourselves."]],[330,["Our mind is running one side; our body is running another side,"]],[339,["our heart is running in another direction,"]],[342,["our sense organs are running in a different direction,"]],[347,["our liver is functioning in a different way."]],[351,["We are not at all integrated ourselves."]],[355,["And as long as this integration is not there,"]],[358,["even if you feel the Divine Power,"]],[362,["even if you see the working of the Divine Power"]],[365,["and mentally even if you accept that, “This is what is happening to us! It is there!”"]],[372,["And you see for yourself, even, the pulsation of the Kundalini,"]],[378,["the rising of the Kundalini, the breaking of the Sahasrara,"]],[381,["even then it is difficult to believe that Sahaja Yoga is the only way"]],[388,["to have your rebirth."]],[391,["On this point some people will fizzle out."]],[394,["The others will fizzle out that, “Why it’s Mother who has to do it?”"]],[398,["Then there could be other problems also with people that,"]],[403,["“Why didn’t happen to other people."]],[406,["They had to work very hard and why didn’t they get Realisation?”"]],[410,["How the mind works it is something very amazing."]],[415,["And as I know all the permutations and combinations of human negativity"]],[425,["about his Realisation,"]],[427,["I compassionately feel that it should be explained to them"]],[432,["why they do it."]],[433,["I know it’s very frustrating sometimes and people feel so disgusted."]],[438,["I have seen some Sahaja Yogis thinking that, it’s better to give up"]],[442,["and cancel England out of the map of Sahaj Yoga,"]],[445,["or cancel France out of the map of Sahaj Yoga."]],[447,["But that’s not the way."]],[450,["We have to understand that their own connections are not yet built-in."]],[457,["For example, this machine on which I am speaking now,"]],[462,["is connected to the mains."]],[466,["But if it is not connected within itself, it will not work out."]],[470,["Both things are important, that it should be connected outside"]],[475,["as well as connected within."]],[478,["And that connection within is very, very much lacking in the modern human beings."]],[485,["There are many reasons for that."]],[488,["First of all, a big movement started long time back,"]],[491,["among human beings, to deny God."]],[494,["To keep it, at the most, as a formal discreet stuff."]],[499,["It’s just a formal thing, you see, you don’t talk of religion at all."]],[503,["You go to church, come back home or you go to a temple, come back home,"]],[506,["sit down."]],[507,["You are a so-called Hindu or a Christian or a Muslim,"]],[510,["or something like that, but don’t discuss it."]],[513,["Because as soon as you start really discussing religion in the real way…"]],[517,["I mean it’s easy to give a sermon sitting on a pulpit,"]],[521,["but to allow it to be discussed and logically sorted out,"]],[528,["it’s impossible to prove because it is mysterious."]],[532,["It is a tremendous power that works it out."]],[543,["This tremendous power that works it out cannot be understood by normal human beings;"]],[551,["cannot be."]],[552,["The working of this is so dynamic and the dimensions into which it works out"]],[558,["is so great, that a human mind cannot understand it, a normal one."]],[563,["Even a Sahaja Yogi, when he gets Realisation,"]],[566,["is trying to understand, first, the dynamism of this Divine Power."]],[574,["And the dynamism of this Divine Power looks so simple, so simple,"]],[579,["but they can’t believe it that it could be that simple."]],[584,["For example, if I say, sitting down here you can find out"]],[592,["about anyone, the way his Kundalini is."]],[598,["I mean this is something people can’t just believe."]],[601,["It’s too much for them to believe."]],[603,["So, suddenly if you are exposed to something so dynamic, so great,"]],[608,["so vast, so effective, so efficient,"]],[613,["it is impossible for human mind to understand that there’s such a great thing"]],[618,["that existed all through."]],[619,["Because they never discussed it, they never talked about it."]],[624,["You are not supposed to talk about it and discuss it."]],[626,["That’s the main thing. You cannot discuss religion."]],[630,["And how far do we discuss even science?"]],[633,["Like they’ll say there is gravity in the Mother Earth. Alright."]],[637,["What is the nature of gravity in the Mother Earth?"]],[639,["How is it there? Why is it there? On that point – finished!"]],[644,["Science doesn’t give that reason."]],[645,["They just say, “There is a pull of gravity in the Mother Earth.” Finished!"]],[650,["Beyond that, they do not want to discuss, they just say, “Alright, up to this point"]],[654,["and beyond that nothing.”"]],[655,["So if you go to a man who is a priest or a religious man"]],[659,["or one who is talking about religion he will say, “Oh that’s God’s mystery."]],[662,["That’s God’s mystery, we cannot go. That’s a mystery.”"]],[666,["So, one says that “You cannot go beyond that, it is so, and that’s why we should not"]],[672,["worry about God.”"]],[673,["The another one says, “Alright, this is the mystery"]],[675,["and the mystery we cannot unravel.”"]],[678,["So, “I’m not a believer in a thing that exists,”"]],[688,["or “I am the believer of a thing that exists but I cannot explain it.”"]],[694,["If you discuss a small thing like – how is it a particular flower becomes a fruit."]],[701,["That is not discussed, you see, in elite society, it is not to be discussed."]],[706,["At the most, you can talk about weather because there cannot be any quarrelling."]],[710,["Even a thing like Falkland Island should not be discussed."]],[714,["Maybe some Argentinean is sitting somewhere there, and he will be hurt about it,"]],[718,["you see, or something might happen."]],[720,["So we are so careful as to what to discuss."]],[723,["But if people sit down and discuss it they will know that there is a tremendous"]],[731,["working of the Divine Power around."]],[734,["Can you count the amount of work it is doing? It’s an impossibility."]],[745,["Like a flower becoming a fruit. Now take only one type of a flower."]],[751,["How many there are in the whole world?"]],[752,["I mean if you think of it you just feel that, “It’s too much.” We just cannot."]],[759,["How this Mother Earth is moving with such a tremendous speed"]],[764,["and we are just settled down nicely here?"]],[766,["How many such suns and stars and constellations are moving?"]],[771,["There’s no end to it."]],[773,["If you go to the microscopic side: just see the skin"]],[776,["and you will be surprised that it is 1/16th of an inch has got such a beautiful,"]],[781,["organised layer which works out all the five functions of the skin."]],[788,["It is tremendous!"]],[791,["And when seeing all these things, in going into science,"]],[795,["if man doesn’t want to realise that there must be a power"]],[799,["that is doing all these organised things"]],[802,["and there must be one organised personality or maybe a controlling thing"]],[809,["that is working it out, then it means that they are trying"]],[814,["to live with a myth because they cannot solve it."]],[817,["The myth is that there is no God."]],[822,["This is the biggest myth I have ever heard."]],[824,["And to believe into such a thing that there is no God is just to accept,"]],[831,["that as you are the highest of all, the lord of all the world,"]],[837,["how can there be anybody higher?"]],[839,["This is one of the biggest hurdles of human beings in the modern times."]],[847,["In the ancient times, olden times, it was so but it was not so much,"]],[853,["to this extent that now man thinks that he is on top of the world"]],[858,["and that he is the one who can guide the whole world and who can manage this"]],[863,["and manage that."]],[864,["For example, I cured a patient about ten days back."]],[869,["I shouldn’t say, “I cured,” because it just happened that she got cured,"]],[873,["through Sahaja Yoga."]],[875,["And she went to the hospital and the doctors saw her."]],[878,["And they said, “No, it can’t be, how can you be cured?"]],[881,["How can you say you are cured?” She said, “I am cured."]],[883,["I have no pain, nothing. I am perfectly alright"]],[885,["and everything is functioning alright.” “But how can it be?”"]],[889,["You see, not to accept anything comes from a fright that,"]],[898,["if you accept something, if you accept that there is Divine Power,"]],[902,["then perhaps you may have no position, no significance."]],[908,["So to be compassionate to people who get Realisation,"]],[912,["you have to tell them that, “It is not that you are overpowered"]],[917,["by the ocean, but you become the ocean. The drop becomes the ocean."]],[922,["Not that the ocean overpowers you.”"]],[926,["Then it may be that you can go further with the second step"]],[932,["where ego is little bit given assurance that, “You won’t be finished.”"]],[937,["The infrastructure has this one problem that, ego has separated all your inner being"]],[949,["into different parts and anything that ego says or is pampered, is good."]],[958,["Good and ego’s happiness are regarded as equal to each other."]],[966,["Now, if you can overcome that first hurdle with people,"]],[973,["that you become the ocean, that you become the guru,"]],[977,["that you become empowered with your own powers,"]],[985,["you have crossed some areas in a personality."]],[992,["And it’s a fact. To begin with, it’s a fact."]],[996,["But this area, actually, you get much later on."]],[1003,["But better to promise that highest, you see."]],[1006,["Like people promise that, “If you do this, you will get"]],[1012,["the Kingdom of Heaven.” “Alright. Then what we’ll get?”"]],[1015,["“Then you will get the Kingdom of Europe.” “Then?”"]],[1019,["“Then you will get the Kingdom of England.” And like that, you see, it moves."]],[1023,["But if you tell them that, “You will get the Kingdom of your own Self.”"]],[1028,["They will say, “What’s there?”"]],[1030,["“The Kingdom of your Self! Such an insipid stuff?”"]],[1035,["So you have to start from the big stuff, saying that, “You become your own guru.”"]],[1044,["Which is a fact! You do become your own guru."]],[1047,["But that happens much later."]],[1048,["But still if you tell them directly that, “You become your own guru.”"]],[1054,["first, it will appeal to them."]],[1057,["They can start thinking immediately, “Alright, if we become the guru,"]],[1061,["we’ll start a big cult, you see? We’ll have a big cult, we’ll have so much."]],[1066,["I’ll also have Rolls-Royces, 58 Rolls-Royces"]],[1069,["and I can demand this and that.”"]],[1071,["All these things may start working in the mind of a person."]],[1074,["Because the concept of a guru is also so nonsensical"]],[1080,["that it is not conceivable for people when you tell them,"]],[1088,["“You’ll become your own guru.”"]],[1090,["But if you tell them, “You’ll become your own guru,”"]],[1093,["they’ll feel happy."]],[1094,["And that’s the point you’ve missed I think John, the other day when you spoke,"]],[1098,["that, “You will become your own guru, that you’ll become.”"]],[1100,["But what does that mean?"]],[1102,["Actually that means that your own religion within you,"]],[1110,["your Ten Commandments within you will be enlightened;"]],[1113,["that you yourself will be correcting yourself all the time."]],[1118,["That means you will guide yourself. Nobody else has to guide you."]],[1122,["You yourself will guide yourself. It means that."]],[1125,["That you will have such a willpower that you will keep to righteousness,"]],[1131,["to correct living, to normal behaviours, to the middle path of life,"]],[1138,["to be compassionate, to be loving, to be honest and that all those things"]],[1144,["will come to you automatically."]],[1145,["That you will give up all your bad habits. “You will become your own guru,” means that."]],[1156,["And that is what when you tell them before, it would be dangerous."]],[1162,["So, I would say that, first of all, if you have to say in a way that,"]],[1168,["“You will become your own guru,” it should not be very much discussed"]],[1173,["and talked to people about."]],[1174,["But it is a fact that, once our own Void or our own religion"]],[1184,["within us, sustenance power, becomes enlightened,"]],[1188,["if you see the light of that, then you enjoy that light,"]],[1192,["you enjoy your virtues, you enjoy your righteousness."]],[1195,["And that righteousness when you start enjoying it,"]],[1199,["you stick on to that. But that happens later on."]],[1203,["The problem is at first only what you feel is tingling or maybe cool breeze."]],[1207,["But this enlightenment of your sustenance happens later when you start enjoying"]],[1217,["your virtues, enjoying the virtues of others, enjoying the righteousness."]],[1221,["And that is what is a difficult thing among human beings."]],[1227,["And because of this delayed action people don’t accept Sahaja Yoga."]],[1235,["Because they want everything in a very fast way."]],[1242,["If they could feel the joy of enjoying the virtues and the righteousness just then,"]],[1249,["then they would not ask any questions."]],[1253,["But in the structure of man this comes later on."]],[1259,["Though you have to unravel that screw before but it is put back the last."]],[1266,["When the Kundalini rises in the Void it goes through this central-most channel"]],[1282,["called as brahmanadi."]],[1283,["Is the central-most among the three nadis, channels, in the central channel."]],[1292,["The central channel is Sushumna and concentrically there are three channels"]],[1298,["placed and the inner-most is brahmanadi."]],[1301,["The other two are called as Chitra and Charini."]],[1304,["Now the first one, it just goes like a single thread of hair"]],[1310,["and pierces through the fontanel bone area."]],[1314,["Now one may say that, “Why not…” You see we can blame God for this that,"]],[1324,["“Why not He had only one channel so that we could feel the impact"]],[1331,["of Realisation very fast?”"]],[1333,["But one has to understand that whatever God does is for our well-being"]],[1340,["and for our hita and for our understanding."]],[1343,["If you go the other way round you see, that when we start hurting"]],[1349,["our central path of Sushumna we start from outside."]],[1356,["Like, you see if you go to a wrong guru, to a cult or to a wrong thing"]],[1361,["where you bend your head or you have faith in something that is artificial"]],[1365,["then the first channel is broken, is hurt."]],[1372,["Now supposing if the whole of the Sushumna channel was made of only one tube-like channel,"]],[1381,["then the whole thing would have been finished."]],[1384,["So, the first one, the outer-most is first attacked by our stupidity that we do –"]],[1393,["is to bow to someone who is a fake person."]],[1399,["Or we go to things, we believe in things who is fake."]],[1403,["It is also harmed in the people who are very arrogant"]],[1414,["and think no end of themselves and they think that,"]],[1418,["“We are the lord of the whole world.”"]],[1420,["That, “We can teach everyone, and everybody else has just to learn from us!”"]],[1425,["That, “We are the best sect or the best organisation"]],[1430,["or maybe the best religion or ‘the chosen ones’.”"]],[1434,["Also there, first layer of the Charini is hurt."]],[1446,["So, at the very gross level it is first hit by these two types of people."]],[1455,["Now, the second one also can be hurt by people who practice"]],[1464,["all kinds of nonsensical things."]],[1468,["Like I have met many Sahaja Yogis who have been to all kinds of nonsensical things"]],[1472,["and have practiced very perverted type of practices,"]],[1480,["very perverted, and all kinds of perverted ideas."]],[1487,["Like, they will go to a cult – I have seen some people"]],[1492,["who have been to a cult, for example – and there it is preached"]],[1497,["that you should not even look at your wife, or some sort of a thing, nonsense."]],[1503,["And they are having relations with other women."]],[1506,["Like there’s another cult in India, I don’t know it is spreading here also perhaps,"]],[1512,["where people believe that you should never get married"]],[1516,["and you should lead a very chaste life, you should be virgins."]],[1520,["But the virgins have – what you call to men virgins"]],[1525,["in English language? Oh whatever it is! I don’t know if you have any."]],[1530,["But what you call them – men virgins, we call them brahmacharis and brahmacharinis."]],[1536,["So the brahmacharis, you see the men virgins –"]],[1539,["I don’t know if you have any cult like that, but I think the priests are here"]],[1543,["like supposed to be brahmacharis."]],[1545,["So the brahmacharis and the brahmacharinis"]],[1548,["should lead a life of complete celibacy and should not marry."]],[1553,["They should not marry. Not that they should lead a life of celibacy."]],[1556,["They should not marry."]],[1557,["They should not marry, but there is no compulsion as to what sort of life"]],[1564,["you should lead!"]],[1565,["Now, it is such a contrasting thing! You should not marry for what?"]],[1572,["For leading a celibate life."]],[1575,["And then with that what is the other contrast you have?"]],[1579,["Is that you are leading a bad life with other people!"]],[1583,["That’s allowed."]],[1584,["These kind of perversions when we have in life, or all kinds of perverted things"]],[1592,["we are doing these days in modern times, all sorts of improper things,"]],[1595,["touches the second nadi which is the Chitra. I mean, I can’t even imagine!"]],[1602,["I don’t know so many things what human beings do, to what extent."]],[1605,["But these are the buffer nadis outside."]],[1608,["And that’s why there’s the very subtle one which is called as the brahmanadi"]],[1617,["is used by Kundalini."]],[1620,["But first, to begin with, when She rises, She tests you and finds out"]],[1627,["what sort of an ascent She’s going to have."]],[1630,["So, only a thread will rise first of all."]],[1635,["Because supposing if there is a hit on say five, six threads they are hurt"]],[1642,["and then they become very weak and they fall down."]],[1646,["So, a very subtle, one thread we can say out of that, comes up to pierce"]],[1656,["the fontanel bone area."]],[1657,["Now this is the structure within us, which does this."]],[1661,["Is done the same way as a seed sprouts or any living thing happens,"]],[1668,["like a flower becomes a fruit. It’s the same way. It’s a living process."]],[1672,["So, when this one rises up and pierces the fontanel bone area,"]],[1677,["at that time, when there’s a little touch with the All-pervading Power,"]],[1685,["which is subtle, by our subtlety you start feeling this cool breeze in the hand."]],[1691,["But still there are two more nadis surrounding it which have to expand"]],[1696,["and get more of the Kundalini coming up."]],[1699,["So now we cannot blame God for this kind of doing"]],[1705,["because He knows that human beings are like this."]],[1708,["We try all the time to ruin ourselves, morning till evening, in every way possible."]],[1717,["Sometimes trying to please our ego or sometimes trying to please our superego –"]],[1723,["all our conditionings."]],[1724,["First of all we never will accept any knowledge from anyone"]],[1730,["which is True Knowledge and we always want to try ourselves."]],[1738,["Now anybody who talks to us with the authority, with that purity"]],[1747,["and with that holiness we don’t like such a person. We abhor!"]],[1750,["But anybody who plays upon our weaknesses, upon our ego and superego,"]],[1758,["who is really harming us and we are not aware"]],[1764,["that we are harmed by these things, we are not aware at all."]],[1766,["Like a person like Freud now: Freud must be a really of the category of Hitler."]],[1774,["Hitler was on a very gross level but Freud was a subtler one."]],[1778,["He has ruined human beings, absolutely!"]],[1782,["You can see that in Kundalini, how he has ruined the innocence of people."]],[1787,["Their sense of shame, decency, decorum, which is a gross thing"]],[1790,["and by putting perversions into their heads"]],[1794,["now what we have are societies which are just like living like animals."]],[1799,["And this is what one has to realise that the people who talk about harming us"]],[1811,["we accept them more than those who want to construct us."]],[1817,["Now those who want to construct us will definitely tell you"]],[1823,["that this is not the way it has to happen."]],[1825,["Because if they have real concern and real worry about you,"]],[1831,["they are not bothered about their cheap popularity,"]],[1833,["they are not bothered about pleasing you for anything,"]],[1838,["because there is no gain as such, except for the satisfaction"]],[1842,["that you have told the Truth to people."]],[1845,["So this infrastructure that is within us, the more modern we become the worse it becomes."]],[1854,["And this infrastructure, if it gets spoiling more, and more, and more,"]],[1861,["then it is an impossible task to communicate with them"]],[1869,["or to inform them of the Truth."]],[1873,["Though they might feel cool breeze in the hand, they might get the experience"]],[1877,["and all that, but it doesn’t fit into their head."]],[1880,["I have known people who have done that way"]],[1884,["and sometimes it is amazing how thousands get Realisation"]],[1890,["and very few remain into that state where they want to gain"]],[1895,["the deeper significance of Sahaja Yoga."]],[1899,["Unless and until they get to the deeper significance of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1904,["they are not going to accept it. They are not going to recognise it."]],[1908,["It’s a sad thing but it is so that, one has to touch the being very deeply"]],[1915,["because it’s a beautiful being which is being ruined by various things,"]],[1921,["as I have described to you. There’s no end to it."]],[1924,["All these circumstances, keeping into view,"]],[1929,["one has to be very, very careful and compassionate towards people"]],[1934,["who are seeking and who are coming, because these are seekers of the ancient times"]],[1941,["they have been seeking."]],[1942,["Now, as the time has passed, of course, the communication of the Divine has improved,"]],[1950,["definitely it has improved."]],[1953,["Because you have seen that we can give mass Realisation,"]],[1957,["people can get mass Realisation."]],[1960,["You have seen in India that it can happen."]],[1963,["So the communication from the Divine Power has improved,"]],[1967,["but the communication from the human power is reduced,"]],[1970,["reduced and also is very much wounded."]],[1978,["So if you see the Kundalini – I don’t know if you can see the Kundalini"]],[1983,["of some people or most of you – you will be amazed that it is really"]],[1988,["a wounded Kundalini."]],[1989,["She has hit many points which has hurt Her. Because you didn’t respect,"]],[1997,["you didn’t respect Her."]],[2000,["You did not know how to respect Her nor you could meet people"]],[2006,["who guided you properly how to respect that special thing"]],[2014,["that God has given you, the special blessing of this Kundalini"]],[2018,["which is within you."]],[2019,["Is the primule, is a very tender thing, is so beautiful, it is eternal within you"]],[2030,["which has to rise and give you Realisation."]],[2033,["Now this is your Mother, which is waiting for an opportunity to give you your Realisation."]],[2040,["And this Mother has no way to come up because we have hurt the path"]],[2047,["through which She has to come and She is also jarred."]],[2051,["I would say She is coiled like a tape within ourselves."]],[2056,["This is the structure of this Mother."]],[2060,["She is coiled in three-and-a-half coils and She has to rise you."]],[2065,["Now think of a tape recorder which is put on a sea which is turbulent"]],[2083,["and sharks are eating it off and then it is burnt –"]],[2091,["all sorts of things that can be used to damage it have been done."]],[2095,["Still it is quite intact. Of course there are little problems with it."]],[2103,["It is still quite powerful."]],[2105,["It is still expecting that great happening for which you are born,"]],[2111,["for which you are seeking, for which you are on this Earth."]],[2115,["She’s there."]],[2115,["You can’t think of any human mechanism of that delicacy, that sensitivity,"]],[2124,["that beauty, that understanding and that strength."]],[2130,["It’s hopeful against hopes."]],[2133,["And that is the thing still preserved there,"]],[2141,["because it is protected by your innocence which is still there, little bit left."]],[2148,["You see whatever you may try with your innocence,"]],[2153,["as you cannot create a complete vacuum, you cannot get rid of it the whole."]],[2159,["So whatever part is left of your innocence is guarding that"]],[2164,["and that essence is still waiting, is there."]],[2170,["Whatever you might have done, whatever wrongs you might have done"]],[2174,["makes no difference because Kundalini is intact."]],[2178,["But what is the problem is the other way round:"]],[2183,["that the mechanism of God is perfect."]],[2187,["The mechanism of Divine Power to give Realisation to thousands"]],[2193,["is absolutely in perfect state. Absolutely, I can tell you."]],[2198,["But to make your brains understand the importance of your Self,"]],[2205,["of your being, of your purpose, of your meaning, is difficult –"]],[2212,["because it is not integrated."]],[2214,["Your heart does not know your brain and whatever happens to your heart"]],[2221,["is not communicated to your brain."]],[2222,["If you reasonably see certain things and logically see something happening,"]],[2228,["still your heart may refuse if it’s a weak heart, if it has weaknesses."]],[2233,["But the Kundalini has the beauty to strengthen your heart,"]],[2240,["to strengthen your brain, to strengthen your liver,"]],[2243,["to strengthen all your being, and to integrate it,"]],[2248,["but She must be given a chance."]],[2250,["If you don’t give Her a chance, you are not fair to yourself."]],[2254,["People are fair to others but when are they going to be"]],[2258,["fair to themselves?"]],[2259,["Ego is the not the way we are going to be fair to ourself"]],[2266,["because ego is a nonsensical horse on which we are sitting."]],[2269,["It’s like John Gilpin’s horse which takes you round and round the places"]],[2275,["reaches you nowhere for your wedding day. It’s that kind of a nonsense."]],[2280,["So if you are playing with John Gilpin’s horse"]],[2284,["and if you are satisfied with it and you think it’s a big fun,"]],[2288,["we are harming ourselves."]],[2291,["So to get to the real point is that to understand what is our infrastructure."]],[2299,["The outside one is alright. We import things in India."]],[2306,["We can import anything for India but we cannot take it to the villages,"]],[2314,["we have no way to there, there’s no road."]],[2316,["So that structure within us has to be built-in"]],[2325,["with our own coordination and cooperation."]],[2329,["We have to cooperate with it."]],[2333,["As God has taken all the care to build in the structure without, outside you,"]],[2342,["and also inside you He placed nice thing, and you were the trustee of that,"]],[2347,["you were in charge of that, but it is spoilt."]],[2351,["So you must give time for this inner structure to come up."]],[2358,["Now some people are unnecessarily frightened also."]],[2363,["I have seen some people frightened of I don’t know what."]],[2368,["Sometimes I think that we are frightened of too much of purity or all sort of things  I've heard of holiness"]],[2376,["or they are frightened of anything."]],[2379,["For such people I would say they should read God’s words about it,"]],[2388,["that you should not be frightened."]],[2389,["He is compassion, He is love and these things are there."]],[2397,["These are not the words of somebody who is giving you a sermon."]],[2402,["I am telling you the Truth. It is there."]],[2404,["But you have to come up to that point to feel that beauty of that Truth,"]],[2410,["to enjoy that Truth."]],[2412,["And once you start enjoying that Truth then there’s no problem for Me."]],[2416,["There are some here sitting, quite a lot of them, who have felt that way."]],[2421,["But you have to have understanding that the inner structure is still to be rebuilt"]],[2429,["and completely integrated and for this you have to give some time"]],[2437,["to yourself, some patience to yourself and some compassion."]],[2440,["Not to be frustrated, disgusted with yourself."]],[2444,["Some cases have been very difficult, I know. It’s impossible!"]],[2448,["I have to be very strict with them, I have to thrash them, do all kinds of things,"]],[2455,["but still there are cases which are to be thrashed out,"]],[2458,["doesn’t matter. We’ll work it together. Somehow, we’ll manage it."]],[2462,["Thrashing doesn’t mean real thrashing, but thrashing with love!"]],[2466,["And all these things have worked out with so many, so why not with you?"]],[2472,["But you have to know one thing that you are seekers of ancient times"]],[2476,["and this is the time that was promised and this is the way you are going to get it."]],[2481,["There’s no doubt about it and instead of doubting it, please have it."]],[2486,["Take it within yourself, allow it to permeate, work it out and see for yourself"]],[2493,["that the power you have got is the power of God’s love."]],[2498,["May God bless you. Thank you."]],[2504,["I would like to have some questions if you have any, will be a good idea."]],[2510,["Somebody should come here."]],[2515,["I mean sometimes you know, I can’t hear some of their languages!"]],[2519,["I have a language problem. (laughing)"]],[2521,["Gavin can you come down here."]],[2525,["It’s only this lifetime I have learnt English language,"]],[2533,["otherwise I never knew that before."]],[2535,["Just anybody who wants to ask a question please ask, please. Go ahead!"]],[2544,["Not to be afraid of or frightened of anything. This is a temple you are in."]],[2565,["No questions? It’s very good."]],[2567,["Yes my child?"]],[2580,["You see, to begin with, you have to have your Realisation"]],[2583,["so that you get the light within yourself."]],[2586,["But the light is not so clear-cut in the beginning, all right?"]],[2588,["Then you have to have your chakras cleared out and you have to have"]],[2592,["your Kundalini up there all the time, to feel the whole thing working out."]],[2596,["And for that, we have certain suggestions for you, how to clear out."]],[2602,["Because you start feeling your chakras on your fingertips to begin with."]],[2606,["You see, you start feeling them."]],[2607,["So, you know that supposing now this chakra is catching, for example."]],[2611,["Seeker: Yes?"]],[2614,["Shri Mataji: Now in your case, this one is catching, all right?"]],[2616,["Why, because you have a weak eyesight."]],[2620,["Seeker: What?"]],[2624,["Shri Mataji: Weak eyesight. If you have a weak eyesight,"]],[2630,["then the – you see here, the cerebellum becomes weak at the back."]],[2633,["All right? Now how to get better eyesight, how to get that portion corrected?"]],[2636,["We have a particular method by which we do."]],[2640,["You see, by light, you have to put the light here."]],[2643,["Then the sun’s rays you have to take it in a particular way,"]],[2647,["and a little exercise is there which one has to do."]],[2654,["And you’ll be amazed, you may have to give up your spectacles very soon."]],[2656,["It’s like that. What I am saying, that it is pertaining to all the chakras"]],[2662,["on both the sides, means left and right."]],[2663,["Now the left side is the emotional side and the right side is the physical"]],[2666,["and the mental side."]],[2669,["Now whatever are our problems on the Left side and the Right side,"]],[2675,["we have different methods by which we can correct."]],[2676,["Now if one method doesn’t work out with you, maybe another may work out."]],[2681,["But it does work out."]],[2682,["As it is, the upsurge of the Kundalini itself solves many problems."]],[2686,["Upsurge of the Kundalini."]],[2690,["So, the best thing to keep your chakras clear is to first of all,"]],[2695,["keep your heart clean, you see. You should keep your heart clean,"]],[2697,["means you should not allow bad thoughts to walk in."]],[2701,["Now how do we do that? How to?"]],[2703,["Because if you are at the point- this one is, at thoughtless awareness point,"]],[2707,["then there is no thought."]],[2710,["The first thing one has to do is to achieve that position"]],[2714,["when you are thoughtlessly aware, and that’s not so difficult."]],[2718,["There are so many ways by which you just sustain that position."]],[2723,["First of all, you jump out, absolutely you get the vibrations here,"]],[2726,["but then to put it down here is important because unless and until the Kundalini"]],[2728,["is kept here, the thoughts start coming from all the sides"]],[2732,["and then you cannot work it out so well."]],[2736,["But it works so fast, you can’t imagine."]],[2738,["I have known people who were alcoholics, next day they just gave up,"]],[2743,["Next day just they gave up."]],[2747,["There are people like that: ‘druggists and chemists’ I call them,"]],[2751,["and just one day over, finished, over it."]],[2753,["It can be like that. So you see, depends on…But doesn’t matter,"]],[2755,["not to get disgusted with yourself."]],[2760,["You must love yourself, that’s the main point is."]],[2763,["That if you love yourself as I love you and I’m bothered about you, it will work out."]],[2768,["It will work out."]],[2768,["Seeker: So love is important for us."]],[2769,["Shri Mataji: Beg your pardon?"]],[2778,["Seeker: You have to love?"]],[2782,["Shri Mataji: You have to…?"]],[2785,["Seeker: You have to love yourself?"]],[2788,["Shri Mataji: Yes, you have to love yourself. And in love, we don’t try to harm ourselves."]],[2791,["A mother who loves the child, she will also tell that, “Now don’t do this."]],[2793,["This is not good!” Supposing the child is trying to put finger into some fire"]],[2799,["or something. Isn’t it? That’s what happens to you."]],[2803,["You start guiding yourself. You just don’t do it."]],[2805,["It just happens to you."]],[2810,["You get that kind of a personality which does what is right, right for yourself."]],[2815,["And it is such a mutual thing, you see?"]],[2819,["But you must have patience is what I’m trying to say there."]],[2822,["Don’t get impatient with yourself. If you get impatient then love is decreased."]],[2827,["Seeker: Can’t hear you."]],[2830,["Shri Mataji: Love is decreased in you. Alright?"]],[2833,["So you have to have patience with yourself. Because it may be,"]],[2839,["there might be some chakra is not clean as yet, may be, possibly."]],[2844,["But when we have cured people who were suffering, say from blood cancer,"]],[2851,["who are great Sahaja Yogis today. So why not you?"]],[2853,["I mean, it’s very easy."]],[2863,["It has to be easy because it’s a living process, alright?"]],[2866,["Seeker: But what I want to know is, is it all free?"]],[2871,["Shri Mataji: Oh, it’s all free (laughter). Absolutely hundred percent."]],[2874,["Hundred percent. Everything is absolutely free."]],[2877,["Seeker: But I myself ????."]],[2882,["Shri Mataji: You should! Because you can imagine, if you love yourself,"]],[2888,["how much fees are you going to pay? (laughing)"]],[2894,["See, this is that much absurd, to say to pay fees for love!"]],[2898,["You can’t imagine a person who just loves you,"]],[2904,["just loves for love’s sake. Can you think of someone?"]],[2910,["In our concept we can have someone, maybe. I think you had it in your concept"]],[2913,["otherwise I would not have been here! There is no fees."]],[2917,["You don’t talk of fees. Alright? No question. Everything is free."]],[2921,["All my love, everything."]],[2926,["I don’t know. I don’t understand money. You will be amazed. I am hopelessly bad."]],[2931,["I just don’t understand money. I am so bad that I just don’t know anything."]],[2938,["If you ask me to cash one check in the bank,"]],[2942,["I’ll have to ask Gavin to write for me. I really don’t know."]],[2946,["I just can’t learn about it, alright? But love I know. That I know very well."]],[2952,["And you will also know. It’s absolutely free."]],[2956,["So just don’t worry on that point. It has to be!"]],[2960,["This air, what do we pay for it? Nothing."]],[2962,["Now we have of course a place where people can stay"]],[2966,["and it’s quite a nice place."]],[2970,["And for your stay you have to pay about… they charge fifteen pounds per week,"]],[2971,["that’s all, for staying in London. Some nice place we have got."]],[2975,["Of course that, I will not pay for your stay there!"]],[2978,["That’s what you have to pay for, if you are staying there,"]],[2983,["for your room where you stay. It’s a very nice place it’s a huge big place."]],[2987,["For that you have to pay fifteen pounds as rent for the room."]],[2987,["That’s a different point."]],[2998,["But you don’t pay for my vibrations or for my knowledge or for anything."]],[3006,["Alright? It should be made clear-cut."]],[3010,["It doesn’t mean it’s a charity hospital where people can come and stay free,"]],[3017,["have food free. That’s not the point. For your food and for your stay"]],[3019,["you have to pay."]],[3025,["Seeker: I understand. The course and the instruction is all free."]],[3028,["Shri Mataji: Absolutely. Not only, but all the attention your will have, free."]],[3029,["All the complete attention, absolutely free. Is that clear now?"]],[3035,["It’s amazing isn’t it? But it is so."]],[3043,["Seeker: Yes, it’s amazing."]],[3046,["Shri Mataji: Yes, it is so. Alright. What else? It’s a good question he asked."]],[3048,["Very sweet question, you know."]],[3055,["Seeker: Is there a danger if you awaken the Kundalini?"]],[3057,["Shri Mataji: Who says that? Can I see the gentleman?"]],[3061,["Seeker: It’s me."]],[3066,["Shri Mataji: Ah, alright. Not at all. You have read?"]],[3068,["Seeker: Surely if it rises too fast?"]],[3072,["Shri Mataji: You see these are the people who are naive. Not only that,"]],[3075,["but they are the people who do not know a word about Kundalini."]],[3076,["Now, here are so many people sitting here…"]],[3078,["The Kundalini is your Mother, and awakening Her, how can there be a danger?"]],[3081,["Will there be a danger if you have to sprout a seed?"]],[3087,["It’s a living process. How can there be a danger?"]],[3096,["You see these are stupid people or these are unholy people, unauthorised."]],[3101,["They don’t know a word about Kundalini."]],[3102,["They try to put their hands onto wrong things, do all wrong things."]],[3107,["It can be a possession. It can be anything."]],[3110,["They don’t know a word, they have no authority."]],[3118,["You have to have authority."]],[3122,["Divine authority should be there to raise the Kundalini."]],[3123,["Like the Mother Earth, if you put a seed in the Mother earth, it will sprout."]],[3127,["But supposing you open it and operate it and try to take out the primule, it will die."]],[3130,["Alright?"]],[3135,["There’s no danger at all. There’s no danger of any kind."]],[3139,["How can there be, it’s a living process."]],[3145,["Apart from that, it is your breakthrough. It is your second birth."]],[3154,["Even when you were born, you never felt any pain,"]],[3157,["the mother had to go through. That’s it. You don’t have to feel anything."]],[3161,["Of course the other Sahaja Yogis might feel your chakras"]],[3168,["and might feel a little pain here and there."]],[3173,["But it’s very little recording, to know where you have the pain."]],[3178,["But once you become a Sahaja Yogi, when you become an expert"]],[3182,["and you start giving Realisation, then you will also know about it."]],[3185,["There is no danger of any kind at all."]],[3187,["Seeker: Are You saying that there’s no danger if it’s followed correctly"]],[3191,["when we awaken the Kundalini?"]],[3193,["Shri Mataji: No you have to have Divine authority to awaken it."]],[3199,["It’s a living process as sprouting of the seed."]],[3202,["You understand my point? So if you are ordained,"]],[3210,["not through any church or any temple or anything, but it’s a God’s ordain."]],[3216,["Like, we can say, John the Baptist had that power when he came on this Earth."]],[3220,["And there were many in India who had this power, who are ordained, I should say,"]],[3224,["who have a Divine Power within them flowing, who are capable of raising the Kundalini."]],[3231,["They do it without any trouble."]],[3234,["Even seeing them, you might get your rising."]],[3239,["You see from my photograph, Gavin has got Realisation;"]],[3246,["he got his Realisation from my photograph, can you believe it?"]],[3251,["From my photograph only. So many got it from my photograph."]],[3254,["So it can happen."]],[3258,["It is a thing which is to be understood with proper patience, that God exists,"]],[3261,["and He has His own methods, His laws, and the way He works out is dynamic."]],[3264,["Once you become that dynamic being, you will start seeing those working"]],[3265,["through your own hands. You do it."]],[3270,["Now in New York, two-three Sahaja Yogis cured a blood cancer patient"]],[3280,["and the patient went out of the hospital. I was not there, they cured."]],[3284,["They just cured a blood cancer. You can do that yourself."]],[3287,["Yes, it is too fantastic isn’t it? But it is. It has been promised."]],[3291,["You see I was reading Koran and I was amazed that many-a-times it is:"]],[3294,["“The Day of Resurrection, the knowledge will be given to you.”"]],[3296,["“The day of resurrection you will know all about this mystery.”"]],[3300,["All this was written in there and what are these Muslims doing now?"]],[3306,["And what are the Christians doing? And what are the Hindus doing?"]],[3310,["just tell me."]],[3311,["They are fighting over, whether they should play some music"]],[3314,["before the masjid (mosque) or not, that’s all. It’s stupid."]],[3318,["It’s all so gross that if you start thinking from that angle,"]],[3323,["I mean we really get lost, we don’t know."]],[3328,["In the same way about Kundalini, those people who have written,"]],[3331,["I was amazed, a big book like that you see was saying,"]],[3333,["“Kundalini is in the stomach.” I said, “How can that be?”"]],[3340,["It is not! You can see with your naked eye sometimes."]],[3344,["I will show you if somebody has a big obstruction in the Nabhi Chakra,"]],[3347,["then you see it pulsating nicely, this triangular bone,"]],[3349,["very nicely, clearly you can see."]],[3353,["You can see the movement of the Kundalini with your naked eyes."]],[3356,["You can see the piercing of it. Absolutely without any harm to the person."]],[3360,["On the contrary, the one who gets Realisation never get’s any pain, that’s the worst part of it."]],[3361,["I wish they could get a little bit to know that there is problem."]],[3365,["Only those who are giving Realisation get it a little bit, you know?"]],[3368,["Like the mother gets the pain, in the way."]],[3376,["But not the ones who are getting it. They don’t feel anything bad about it."]],[3380,["Supposing a madman comes here, you see, and sits here and he hits you,"]],[3390,["he doesn’t feel anything that he’s hitting you or anything."]],[3393,["It’s only you feel that you are hit, it is like that."]],[3395,["Anybody comes with a problem here, we feel the little pain here"]],[3402,["and the little pain there, but they don’t feel anything"]],[3405,["and we have to work it out on them and clear out because who is the other?"]],[3408,["They are within us."]],[3413,["To feel ourselves alright, we have to treat them."]],[3418,["And how can we pay for that? For treating ourselves how can we pay?"]],[3420,["Do you see this point? Who is the other? They are part and parcel of you."]],[3428,["Then you can’t take any money, you can’t grudge anything alright?"]],[3442,["We have to grow."]],[3444,["It’s so simple as that. Can’t believe it, isn’t it?"]],[3448,["Because you have read too much about Kundalini I believe (laughing)."]],[3449,["Actually, you see, these people have no authority to write."]],[3454,["But everybody can talk about God, about Kundalini, anything."]],[3459,["You see that’s the trouble. Who is going to stop them?"]],[3472,["There’s no legal control over them. Anybody can say whatever they like."]],[3474,["They say about Christ anything. I mean they write anything about anyone."]],[3479,["I am amazed to see all this, but what to do?"]],[3482,["There’s no legal protection for God! (laughing)"]],[3487,["Any more question please?"]],[3498,["There should be no fear of any kind."]],[3501,["The day has come for you to have Realisation."]],[3503,["You are going to get it."]],[3506,["Only what request I have to make, is that, even if you get Realisation today,"]],[3509,["just don’t stop it at that point, that’s all."]],[3512,["You have to go further with it to correct yourself fully, to be the master."]],[3514,["This is one thing you have to promise yourself."]],[3521,["Because we’ll work very hard, and we’ll do anything that is possible,"]],[3524,["everything that is to be done, we’ll really work very hard."]],[3527,["And it will be brought out, you will feel your Realisation."]],[3539,["But I have to make a very humble request, that you should not very speedily stop coming"]],[3545,["and think that, “Oh, now I’ve got Realisation, finished.”"]],[3549,["No it’s not that. Alright?"]],[3556,["That’s something people feel, because sometimes they feel so elated"]],[3559,["at the first thing that they think, “Oh, now we’ve got Realisation, finished,”"]],[3562,["and then after one year they come down with some sort of a problem."]],[3564,["That’s not good."]],[3566,["It grows slowly. Sahaja Yoga itself has grown very slowly in this country,"]],[3569,["and has taken its roots now, gradually."]],[3583,["And I am sure it will take its roots into the hearts of many."]],[3590,["Because this is a special country according to my own understanding."]],[3594,["All the knowledge, everything is free, again I say."]],[3601,["Alright? Now should we have Realisation? Let’s have it. Alright?"]],[3609,["So, can you take out your shoes, will help you a little more."]],[3615,["You have to little bit coordinate because this Mother Earth, you know,"]],[3617,["she helps to suck out lots of our problems."]],[3626,["You just take out your shoes, and I hope it’s not very cold"]],[3630,["down there for you people."]],[3632,["Just take out your shoes, that’s all, just to take out your shoes."]],[3636,["I find some very good people today. There are some nice seekers."]],[3641,["Better to come in front, all those who have come for the first time"]],[3643,["is a good idea. Please come forward, is a good idea to come forward."]],[3649,["Yes. Not to have any apprehension, nothing. It’s just you become because you are ready."]],[3653,["It’s like, as I said that an egg becomes a bird. That’s what it happens."]],[3654,["Alright, very good."]],[3661,["Now we have to know that, as we have shown here,"]],[3680,["there are on these tips of our fingers, first we feel the centres that are within us."]],[3687,["And these are seven centres."]],[3694,["This is the first centre, second, third, and then the fourth, fifth, sixth"]],[3699,["and the seventh. No I’m sorry, sixth and the seventh."]],[3700,["These are the centres here."]]]);
